cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SBML Viewer in your research, please cite it as below."
title: SBML Viewer
abstract: >-
  An Obsidian plugin that turns an SBML systems-biology model into a network of
  linked markdown notes, so the structure of the model — species, reactions,
  compartments, stoichiometry, reversibility and modifiers — can be browsed and
  explored in Obsidian's native graph view. Models are imported from a local file
  or by BioModels identifier. Constructs the plugin does not represent are counted
  and reported in a generated overview note, so nothing is silently omitted.
type: software
